	<section_number>3.2-6517</section_number>
	<catch_line>Remedies cumulative</catch_line>
	<text>
		The remedies provided for pursuant to this article are cumulative and not exclusive and shall be in addition to any other remedy provided for by law.
	</text>
	<history>1984, c. 492, § 29-213.53; 1987, c. 488, § 3.1-796.83; 2008, c. 860.</history>
